@* Align is the reader's own side versus the other person's, which is the whole grammar of a
   chat: end is you, start is them. It follows the writing direction rather than the screen. *@
<div class="flex w-[440px] flex-col gap-2">
    <Bubble Variant="muted"><BubbleContent>Did the invoice go out?</BubbleContent></Bubble>
    <Bubble Align="end"><BubbleContent>Sent it this morning.</BubbleContent></Bubble>
    <Bubble Variant="muted"><BubbleContent>Perfect, thank you.</BubbleContent></Bubble>
</div>
